ue": "Chipotle Mexican Grill|Kathleen Merrigan|PD USDA|Flickr images reviewed by FlickreviewR|Files from U.S. Department of Agriculture Flickr stream|Photographs by the U.S. Department of Agriculture with bad file names|USDA On-Farm Food Safety Project", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "Assessments": {"value": "", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "ImageDescription": {"value": "From left: Agriculture Deputy Secretary Dr. Kathleen Merrigan, Steve Murray, Murray Family Farms, Bakersfield, CA., Phil Petrilli, Regional Director, Chipotle Mexican Grill and Marc Zammit, Vice President, Sustainability and Culinary Initiatives, Compass Group listen to Jim Slama, President and Founder, FamilyFarmed.org’s On-Farm Food Safety Project presentation during a brief overview of the online risk management tool <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.onfarmfoodsafety.org\">www.onfarmfoodsafety.org</a>. Deputy Secretary Merrigan, Murray, Petrilli, Zammit and leaders from agriculture and food organizations announced the release of the online tool at the United States Department of Agriculture in Washington, D.C., on Thursday, December 15, 2011. The On-Farm Food Safety Project is the first of its kind and was developed by a broad coalition of farm and produce industry partners with lead funding from the USDA Risk Management Agency. USDA photo by Bob Nichols.", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "DateTimeOriginal": {"value": "2011-12-15 15:50", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Credit": {"value": "<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/usdagov/6518455831/\">20111215-OSEC-RBN-8792</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Artist": {"value": "<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/41284017@N08\">U.S. Department of Agriculture</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "LicenseShortName": {"value": "Public domain", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "UsageTerms": {"value": "Public domain", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "AttributionRequired": {"value": "false", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Copyrighted": {"value": "False", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Restrictions": {"value": "", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "License": {"value": "pd", "source": "commons-templates", "hidden": ""}}, "mime": "image/jpeg"}]}, {"pageid": 17794426, "ns": 6, "title": "File:20111215-OSEC-RBN-8845 - Flickr - USDAgov.jpg", "imagerepository": "local", "imageinfo": [{"size": 2958600, "width": 2100, "height": 1500, "thumburl": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/20111215-OSEC-RBN-8845_-_Flickr_-_USDAgov.jpg/1280px-20111215-OSEC-RBN-8845_-_Flickr_-_USDAgov.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "thumbwidth": 1280, "thumbheight": 914, "responsiveUrls": {"2": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/20111215-OSEC-RBN-8845_-_Flickr_-_USDAgov.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled"}, "thumbattribs": {"src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/20111215-OSEC-RBN-8845_-_Flickr_-_USDAgov.jpg/1280px-20111215-OSEC-RBN-8845_-_Flickr_-_USDAgov.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "decoding": "async", "loading": "lazy", "width": 1280, "height": 914, "srcset": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/20111215-OSEC-RBN-8845_-_Flickr_-_USDAgov.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x"}, "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/20111215-OSEC-RBN-8845_-_Flickr_-_USDAgov.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "descriptionurl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20111215-OSEC-RBN-8845_-_Flickr_-_USDAgov.jpg", "descriptionshorturl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=17794426", "sha1": "f89299b093b462f57d3945afa4cce7993e12f96f", "extmetadata": {"DateTime": {"value": "2011-12-25 13:48:38", "source": "mediawiki-metadata", "hidden": ""}, "ObjectName": {"value": "20111215-OSEC-RBN-8845 - Flickr - USDAgov", "source": "mediawiki-metadata"}, "CommonsMetadataExtension": {"value": 1.2, "source": "extension", "hidden": ""}, "Categories": {"value": "Chipotle Mexican Grill|Kathleen Merrigan|PD USDA|Flickr images reviewed by FlickreviewR|Files from U.S. Department of Agriculture Flickr stream|Photographs by the U.S. Department of Agriculture with bad file names|USDA On-Farm Food Safety Project", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "Assessments": {"value": "", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "ImageDescription": {"value": "Steve Murray, Murray Family Farms, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bakersfield,_California\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Bakersfield, California\">Bakersfield, CA.</a> a user of the On-Farm Food Safety Project Tool, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.onfarmfoodsafety.org\">www.onfarmfoodsafety.org</a>, described a producers experience with the risk management tool and the fact that it saved him thousands in consultant fees. Murray along with Agriculture Deputy Secretary Dr. <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kathleen_Merrigan\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Kathleen Merrigan\">Kathleen Merrigan</a> and leaders from agriculture and food organizations announced the release of the tool at the United States Department of Agriculture in Washington, D.C., on Thursday, December 15, 2011. To the right are Agriculture Deputy Secretary Dr. Kathleen Merrigan and Phil Petrilli, Regional Director, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chipotle_Mexican_Grill\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Chipotle Mexican Grill\">Chipotle Mexican Grill</a>, a sponsor of On-Farm Food Safety Project. The On-Farm Food Safety Project is the first of its kind and was developed by a broad coalition of farm and produce industry partners with lead funding from the USDA Risk Management Agency. USDA photo by Bob Nichols.", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "DateTimeOriginal": {"value": "2011-12-15 16:09", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Credit": {"value": "<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/usdagov/6518453933/\">20111215-OSEC-RBN-8845</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Artist": {"value": "<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/41284017@N08\">U.S. Department of Agriculture</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "LicenseShortName": {"value": "Public domain", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "UsageTerms": {"value": "Public domain", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "AttributionRequired": {"value": "false", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Copyrighted": {"value": "False", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "Restrictions": {"value": "", "source": "commons-desc-page", "hidden": ""}, "License": {"value": "pd", "source": "commons-templates", "hidden": ""}}, "mime": "image/jpeg"}]}, {"pageid": 17794433, "ns": 6, "title": "File:20111215-OSEC-RBN-8852 - Flickr - USDAgov.jpg", "imagerepository": "local", "imageinfo": [{"size": 2342432, "width": 2100, "height": 1500, "thumburl": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/20111215-OSEC-RBN-8852_-_Flickr_-_USDAgov.jpg/1280px-20111215-OSEC-RBN-8852_-_Flickr_-_USDAgov.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "thumbwidth": 1280, "thumbheight": 914, "responsiveUrls": {"2": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/20111215-OSEC-RBN-8852_-_Flickr_-_USDAgov.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled"}, "thumbattribs": {"src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/20111215-OSEC-RBN-8852_-_Flickr_-_USDAgov.jpg/1280px-20111215-OSEC-RBN-8852_-_Flickr_-_USDAgov.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.o